# What a deploy uploads. The Git integration ships the tracked tree; a deploy
# run from a checkout uploads the whole directory unless this file says
# otherwise. Without it the CLI sent desktop/dist (3 GB of installers) and
# eighteen agent worktrees (2.7 GB) and never finished the upload.
.claude/
desktop/
android/
dist/
node_modules/
.env*
test-results/
playwright-report/
.playwright/
.git/
